Package: navidrome
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: systemd
Recommends: ffmpeg
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://www.navidrome.org
Description: Navidrome Music Server - your personal streaming service
 Navidrome is a self-hosted music server and streamer. Point it at your
 music folder (including TOS shared folders) and stream your collection
 to any browser or Subsonic-compatible app, with playlists, favorites,
 play counts, smart playlists and multi-user support.
 .
 The web UI opens in a new browser tab via the TOS App Center route
 /navidrome/. The backend listens on loopback only; no external port is
 exposed. The first visit walks you through creating the admin account.
 Music, databases and caches are stored in /var/lib/navidrome.
 Audio format transcoding requires ffmpeg (recommended, installed
 automatically when available in the repository).
